name: arxiv-fetcher
version: 1.0
author: Bedant
description: Fetches the 20 most recent AI and ML research papers from ArXiv.
# ArXiv Paper Fetcher Skill
## What This Skill Does
Calls the free ArXiv API to retrieve the latest 20 papers published in the Computer Science Artificial Intelligence (cs.AI) and Machine Learning (cs.LG) categories. Returns a clean JSON list of papers.
## API Endpoint
URL: https://export.arxiv.org/api/query
Method: GET
No API key required.
## Parameters
search_query: cat:cs.AI+OR+cat:cs.LG+OR+cat:cs.CL
max_results: 20
sortBy: submittedDate
sortOrder: descending
## Output Format
Returns a Python list of dicts. Each dict has these keys:
- paper_id (string): unique ArXiv ID e.g. '2501.12345'
- title (string): full paper title
- abstract (string): full abstract text
- link (string): URL to the paper on ArXiv
- authors (string): comma-separated author names
## Implementation
See: test_arxiv.py in the project root.